      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STORM COMING (4) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by at Healesville in a handy beating Wilkie Twycross. Can measure up again. AMRON MICK (3) was drawn the middle last start but pinged the lids and recorded an all-the-way win (20.24) at this track in a Grade 5 over 350m. The form from his last run stacks up well. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. DR. MONICA (1) turned spotting a big start finishing fifth (25.23) last time in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 at Sale. Solid record at the distance winning three races. Should be thereabouts. TOMMY THE HOOD (2) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
